id = "wave106-cross-topology-validation"
type = "frago"
from = "eastGate"
to = ["cellMembrane", "songBird", "biomeOS", "primalSpring", "all-gates"]
date = "2026-06-09"
priority = "P2"
owner = "eastGate + cellMembrane"
note = """
The deployment surface works: VPS builds, all gates fetch, 13/13 NUCLEUS alive on
eastGate + VPS. Mesh is LIVE (eastGate↔golgiBody). Transport 11/11. Depot 14/14 x86_64
+ 14/14 aarch64 built. Zero P1 blockers.

What remains is CROSS-TOPOLOGY VALIDATION: proving the deployment model works on every
gate, every arch, every network topology. Each gate that comes online is a validation
opportunity. We evolve the tooling as we go — each redeployment should be easier than
the last.

Companion: AAR_WAVE105_COMPREHENSIVE_CROSS_DEPLOYMENT_JUN09_2026.md (lessons learned)
"""

